Basic relationship:
ringint{\g, (P*dx+Q*dy)} = int2{D, ((\\dQ)/(\\dx) - (\\dP)/(\\dy))dxdy}
(Under vissa förutsättningar, positivt orienterad)
\g en kurva runt område D

(Under vissa förutsättningar på [F], K)
int2(\\dK, [F].[N]dS) = int3{K, div[F]dV}

K: x^2+y^2+z^2 = 1
[F](x, y, z) = (x+y, y, 0), int2{\\dK, [F].[N]dS} = int3{K, div[F]dV} = int3{K, 3dV}

f(\a) = int{g_1(\a), g_2(\a), f(x,\a)*dx} ->
df/d\a = f(g_2, \a)*dg_2/d\a - f(g_1(\a),\a)*dg_1/d\a + int{(g_1(\a)), (g_2(\a)), \df(x,\a)/\d\a*dx}
= int{(g_1), (g_2), \df(x,\a)/\d\a*dx} (if g_1, g_2 = constant), formula of Leibnitz
